DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261111T210000
SUMMARY:Alex Plain | Wonny Jane | On Parade
LOCATION:Berlin\, East Village
DESCRIPTION:Alex Plain invites you to a night of indie rock and folk anthem
 
s\, with original material from himself and his good pal Wonny Jane\, graci
 
ously hosted by Berlin Under A. Alex Plain puts forward a relentless and sp
 
ontaneous energy that imbues his sets with a certain je ne sais quoi that c
 
an only truly be experienced live. idt he rightly ever knows what's gonna h
 
appen when he steps on stage\, nor will he ever. He'd describe himself as a
 
 folk artist but his friends venture to say his music is like if jeff mangu
 
m and weezer had an ugly yet very talented baby. Wonny Jane is an up-and-co
 
ming indie rocker and songwriter blending rock\, pop\, and the occasional f
 
olk twang into a new\, innovative\, viral sound. Come to dance\, hear his a
 
mazing talent\, and find your new favorite earworm and get to say shit like
 
 "yeah i was into him before he blew up." Tickets & info: https://www.ticke
 
tweb.com/event/alex-plain-wonny-jane-berlin-tickets/14297064
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/alex-plain-wonny-jane-berlin-tickets/14
 
297064
